WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.220
In 1974, a young man from Scotland was
ordained as a monk in the Tibetan tradition.

2
00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:08.670
He later trained in Korean Zen.

3
00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:13.960
Then, in 1985, he left monastic
life, and became a lay teacher.

4
00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:17.620
In 2010 he published a book
with a startling title:

5
00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:20.400
Confession of a Buddhist Atheist.

6
00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:23.810
Can you follow the Buddha's path
without believing in rebirth,

7
00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:25.980
or in anything at all?

8
00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:28.190
In this mission, you'll meet that teacher,

9
00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:30.380
Stephen Batchelor, and his critics.

10
00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:35.810
Then you'll set his ideas beside another
voice who answers him very differently.

11
00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:40.240
Your mission: find out whether the Buddha's
path can be followed without belief

12
00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:41.170
in rebirth.
